  "id": "ham-asparagus-and-cheddar-egg-bake",
  "name": "Ham, Asparagus, and Cheddar Egg Bake",
  "subtitle": "A savory egg casserole with vegetables, ham, and two cheeses.",
  "description": "This American-style breakfast bake combines thawed asparagus, ham, peppers, and onion with a seasoned egg batter, then finishes with a melted cheese topping.",
  "meal_type": "breakfast",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
